{"id":"8658210215541698","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-multitape-time-bounds.md","title":"Deterministic Time Complexity","display":"df-deterministic-time-complexity — Deterministic Time Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","aliases":["73-df-multitape-time-bounds","73-df-deterministic-time-complexity"],"display":"df-deterministic-time-complexity — Deterministic Time Complexity","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-multitape-time-bounds</span><span>73-df-deterministic-time-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic-time-complexity — Deterministic Time Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (input alphabet)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\)</span> (deterministic multitape TM, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (time-bound function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span> 及部分值记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>；代价定义在且仅在所列候选集合非空的输入上。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\ns:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\n\\land s(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(s(i)\\to_M s(i+1))\n\\land\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\,\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\;\ns(m)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,s)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\ns:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\operatorname{MConf}_M\n\\land s(0)=C_M^{\\mathsf{in}}(w)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(s(i)\\to_M s(i+1))\n\\land\\exists\\mathbf T\\,\\exists\\mathbf h\\,\\exists q\\in\\{q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\;\ns(m)=(q,\\mathbf T,\\mathbf h)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{time}_M(w)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists s\\;\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,s)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{time}_M(w)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists s\\;\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M(w,m,s)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\exists M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(M)\\land L=L(M)\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(w)\\downarrow\\\\\n\\qquad{}\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n(|w|\\geq n_0\\to\\operatorname{time}_M(w)\\leq c\\,t(|w|))\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}time\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*:\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\exists M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\mathbf 2}(M)\\land L=L(M)\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(w)\\downarrow\\\\\n\\qquad{}\\land\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf 2^*\\;\n(|w|\\geq n_0\\to\\operatorname{time}_M(w)\\leq c\\,t(|w|))\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The run and time functions are defined for the machine's own input alphabet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>; the class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\">\\(\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\\)</span> then specializes them to binary languages.</li>\n<li>The minimum exists only for a halting computation; membership in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\">\\(\\mathsf{DTIME}(t)\\)</span> separately requires it for every input.</li>\n<li>Big-O is expanded into explicit constants, so the resource bound is not hidden in an undeclared asymptotic predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})$ with $\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(M)$ (deterministic multitape TM, see [[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 及部分值记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]；代价定义在且仅在所列候选集合非空的输入上。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},k,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\opera