\\operatorname{HaltingRun}_M$ (finite halting run, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])"},{"id":"4aece652594d9d3c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{time}_M$ (halting-run length, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])"},{"id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{time}_M,\\mathsf{DTIME}$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]；$\\operatorname{NTimeBound},\\mathsf{NTIME}$ 见 [[73-df-nondeterministic-time-bounds]]。"},{"id":"dfb238ddf618b68f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DTIME}$ (deterministic multitape time classes, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])"}],"outgoing":["9fa7db79fea5f29a","773cae915e5165f3"]}